---
Delete a sensor with all its readings, anomalies, commands and shares.
This cannot be undone. Asks first unless --yes is given.

Usage: hn sensors delete [OPTIONS] <SENSOR>

Arguments:
  <SENSOR>  Sensor id

Options:
  -y, --yes   Do not ask
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn sensors delete <sensor-id>
  hn sensors delete <sensor-id> --yes
